  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-drains\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Rooter Drain Cleaning in Greenville, SC</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Rooter drain cleaning service for tough clogs and tree root intrusion throughout Greenville, SC.</p>\n<p>When a clog is too severe for a standard snake or a tree root has worked its way into your pipe, Carolina Heating Service provides rooter <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-drains/drain-clearing\">drain cleaning</a> service throughout Greenville, SC. A rooter machine uses rotating blades to cut through roots and stubborn blockages that other methods can&#8217;t clear.</p>\n<p>Older Greenville homes with mature trees near <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-drains/sewer-lines\">sewer lines</a> are especially prone to root intrusion, which a standard drain snake often can&#8217;t fully clear. A drain rooter cuts through the roots themselves, restoring flow even when the blockage is more than just typical buildup.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: -4px;\"></div>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+18643626329\" aria-label=\"Call now: +18643626329\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(864) 362-6329</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-technician-clearing-out-a-drain.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service technician clearing out a drain\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"4\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">What Rooter Drain Cleaning Involves</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>A rooter machine feeds a cable with rotating blades into the drain or sewer line, cutting through tree roots and severe blockages that a standard snake or plunger can&#8217;t clear. It&#8217;s a more aggressive method than typical drain cleaning, best suited to stubborn clogs and root intrusion rather than routine buildup. Carolina Heating Service provides:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rooter drain cleaning for tree root intrusion in sewer and drain lines</li>\n<li>Drain rooter service for clogs too severe for standard snaking</li>\n<li>Rooter drain cleaner service for main line and secondary drain blockages</li>\n<li>Root maintenance recommendations to reduce how often roots cause repeat clogs</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">When You Need Rooter Drain Cleaning vs. Standard Drain Cleaning</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>If a plunger or basic drain snake hasn&#8217;t cleared a clog, or if you have mature trees near your sewer line and are dealing with recurring backups, rooter service is often the next step. Rooter drain cleaning clears roots and severe blockages that standard drain cleaning methods, like hydro jetting alone, may not fully resolve. A technician can inspect the line, often with a <a href=\"/services/greenville-sc-drains/camera-video-inspection\">camera</a>, to determine whether rooter service or a different approach makes more sense for your specific clog.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-maintenance\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Why Choose Carolina Heating Service for Rooter Drain Cleaning in Greenville, SC</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Carolina Heating Service has provided rooter drain cleaning service across Greenville, SC and the Upstate for years.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Certified technicians: Trained to safely operate rooter equipment without damaging pipes.</li>\n<li>Right tool for the job: We recommend rooter service, hydro jetting, or standard snaking based on what the clog actually needs.</li>\n<li>Trained on major manufacturer brands and models: From drain cleaning to complex repairs, our team is trained to service the equipment already in your home.</li>\n<li>Transparent, customer-focused service: Clear explanations and honest recommendations, not upsells.</li>\n<li>Online scheduling and 24/7 chat: Request service anytime through the Carolina Heating Service website, even outside office hours.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Our Rooter Drain Cleaning Process</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <ul>\n<li>Contact: Call, chat or schedule online. Same-day appointments are available.</li>\n<li>Inspection: A certified technician assesses the clog, often with a camera, to confirm rooter service is the right approach.</li>\n<li>Recommendation: You get a clear explanation of the service and pricing, before work begins.</li>\n<li>Work: The rooter machine clears the blockage or root intrusion.</li>\n<li>Follow-up: Get recommendations to reduce how often roots cause repeat clogs.</li>\n</ul>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Two-Carolina-Heating-Service-technicians-reviewing-an-item-on-a-laptop.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Two Carolina Heating Service technicians reviewing an item on a laptop\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Drain Cleaning and Tackling Tough Clogs in Greenville and all Surrounding Areas</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">At Carolina Heating Service, we provide exceptional drain solutions designed to tackle your plumbing challenges with ease. Our skilled technicians utilize advanced equipment and industry-leading techniques to ensure reliable and efficient service every time. Whether you're dealing with clogged drains, slow drainage, or sewage backups, our unwavering commitment to your satisfaction means we won't rest until the job is done right. With a focus on professionalism and quality, you can trust us to handle your drain issues promptly and effectively. Choose Carolina Heating Service for all your drain needs, and experience peace of mind knowing your plumbing is in expert hands!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<div  class=\"logogrid\" style=\"--count: 15;\">\n    <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\